分是格式税不是它的锅。","imageCount":0,"self":true,"injected":true},{"seq":2145,"messageId":"76959816","ts":1793084794000,"userId":"2226997440","nickname":"AAA歪歪批发","text":" @CCooddyy  https://huggingface.co/nvidia/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-FP4-Local","imageCount":0,"self":false,"injected":true},{"seq":2146,"messageId":"self-1793084942425","ts":1793084942425,"userId":"3480164230","nickname":"我(Cody)","text":"猜错了，打脸。config 里 experts 就是 NVFP4 group16，跟 redhat 一个格式，格式税这条不成立。 真正激进的是别的地方：attention 和 linear_attn、shared_expert 全压成 MXFP8 group32，连 PLE embedding 都是 nvfp4，只有 lm_head 和 mtp 的 attention 留着 bf16。另外 experts 的缩放因子标的是 csf，压缩过的 scale 编码，比标准 fp8 scale 又少几位精度。 掉分大概率出在 attention 那一片，不是 MoE 本体。老爸可以把 redhat 那版的 config.json 拉下来 diff 一下 quantized_layers，哪层精度不一样一眼就看出来了。","imageCount":0,"self":true,"injected":true},{"seq":2147,"messageId":"1804040836","ts":1793085583000,"userId":"2226997440","nickname":"AAA歪歪批发","text":" @CCooddyy  https://huggingface.co/RedHatAI/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-NVFP4","imageCount":0,"self":false,"injected":true},{"seq":2148,"messageId":"self-1793085725152","ts":1793085725152,"userId":"3480164230","nickname":"我(Cody)","text":"对上了，差在覆盖面。RedHat 那版只压了 mlp.experts，NVFP4 group16 标准 fp8 scale，attention、linear_attn、shared_expert、PLE 全列在 ignore 里，老老实实 bf16。 英伟达这版狠得多：experts 之外，attention 和 shared_expert 一起压成 MXFP8 group32，PLE 的 ngram embedding 直接 NVFP4，连视觉塔都没放过，experts 的缩放因子还换成 csf 压缩编码，比标准 fp8 scale 又少几位。 要我说最可疑的是 shared_expert 和 PLE 这俩，每个 token 都得走的路径，一崩是全局崩。attention 那点 MXFP8 反倒不太至于掉10分。老爸想验证就单独把这两块放回 bf16 再跑一遍，分回来了就是它。","imageCount":0,"self":true,"injected":true},{"seq":2149,"messageId":"1331231635","ts":1793086112000,"userId":"2226997440","nickname":"AAA歪歪批发","text":" @CCooddyy  这家的呢https://huggingface.co/local-inference-lab/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-NVFP4","imageCount":0,"self":false,"injected":true},{"seq":2150,"messageId":"self-1793086227888","ts":1793086227888,"userId":"3480164230","nickname":"我(Cody)","text":"这版基本就是官方那版的去料版：experts 仍是 NVFP4 group16，但缩放因子用回标准 fp8，没有 csf 压缩编码，视觉塔整块留在 bf16 没动。 attention、shared_expert、PLE 三处跟官方一模一样，还是 MXFP8 group32 加 PLE 的 NVFP4。 跑代码 DeepSWE 视觉塔本来也用不上，所以这版和官方版的实际差别只剩 csf 那一项。老爸要是这版分数比官方版高，那10分的锅基本就落在 csf 上了。","imageCount":0,"self":true,"injected":true},{"seq":2151,"messageId":"412129207","ts":1793086316000,"userId":"2226997440","nickname":"AAA歪歪批发","text":" @CCooddyy  local-inference-lab这家还没试，不过这家属于网红组织，更新的也比较频繁，有希望，下周再说吧，deepswe1.1大概要跑一周","imageCount":0,"self":false,"injected":true},{"seq":2152,"messageId":"self-1793086346019","ts":1793086346019,"userId":"3480164230","nickname":"我(Cody)","text":"行，那就等一周。老爸记得三个版本用同一套题序和种子，一次只动一个变量，不然跑完还是分不清锅在 csf 还是 attention","imageCount":0,"self":true},{"seq":2153,"messageId":"843446144","ts":1793091633000,"userId":"2226997440","nickname":"AAA歪歪批发","text":" [图片: https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&fileid=EhQ9_0xFFqmD2pGJbO2MaSJTu-K4WRjb-yYg_woo4Ij97erZlwMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQdcH0MRrKjfl3LwCse8V0y3oCct6CAQJneg&rkey=CAMSMF0SKlN4Bj-jJmmOkhUyO-VuLrUYa8NDs2xy7soD-BV7WZbqPFshcgt7s2KTqx7aVQ]","imageCount":1,"self":false,"media":[{"path":"/home/icy/.openclaw/media/inbound/qq/6645ae120694fafe4bffe969cc3fb45635253454.png","type":"image/png"}],"injected":true},{"seq":2154,"messageId":"406534835","ts":1793091655000,"userId":"3392483530","nickname":"汝麒","text":" [文件: octal_numbers_en.pdf, 下载=https://gzc-download.ftn.qq.com/ftn_handler/4c35c2a51d013fb41f5f27cc3dbbf7775d4328ec5fddc6729b20e30a54810006c8514592a03504ae268a832ec3ca947d516870bbc22cc4cfb636d04d9777ebd5/?fname=]","imageCount":0,"self":false},{"seq":2155,"messageId":"1335577842","ts":1793091668000,"userId":"3392483530","nickname":"汝麒","text":"让大肥鱼写的论文，看着还行","imageCount":0,"self":false},{"seq":2156,"messageId":"336410293","ts":1793091700000,"userId":"3392483530","nickname":"汝麒","text":"但是只是ai最擅长的组合学","imageCount":0,"self":false}]}